      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.47870635986328,
        527.4566040039062,
        118.92170715332031
      ],
      "text": "recommendations for the four milestones in the cascade of preventive care, namely identification of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.67871856689453,
        527.3728637695312,
        132.12171936035156
      ],
      "text": "risk groups, TB screening and ruling out TB, testing for TBI, and choice and administration of the TPT",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.8787384033203,
        423.5206604003906,
        145.3217315673828
      ],
      "text": "regimen. The second edition of the TPT guidelines will have the same scope.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        152.5825958251953,
        527.410888671875,
        167.0255889892578
      ],
      "text": "Since the previous update of the guidelines, in 2020, several developments have affected TPT policy.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        165.78260803222656,
        527.4409790039062,
        180.22560119628906
      ],
      "text": "They include revision of WHO guidance on screening for TB disease and new modalities for testing",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        177.7067413330078,
        527.4476318359375,
        193.4257354736328
      ],
      "text": "(13,14) for TBI  . In addition, two landmark trials of use of TPT for contacts of people with MDR-TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        190.90663146972656,
        527.3923950195312,
        206.62562561035156
      ],
      "text": "(15,16) have been completed  . In the light of these new developments and continued demand from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        205.3826446533203,
        527.4664916992188,
        219.8256378173828
      ],
      "text": "Member States for guidance on how best to protect people at risk of TB, the 2020 TPT guidelines were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.966499328613281,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        218.5825958251953,
        524.4086303710938,
        233.0255889892578
      ],
      "text": "updated to ensure that the recommendations continue to be based on the latest available evidence.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.8660888671875,
        240.2864532470703,
        507.148681640625,
        254.72950744628906
      ],
      "text": "The current update considered a review of evidence on one question, worded in PICO format :  2",
